<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The three non-body purpose works. These are full XL authored floors, not enlarged generic
  shells. Every variant exposes the exact public, service, operator, machine, input, and output
  contract consumed by KingdomPurposePortfolio. Creed variants change circulation and work
  order while keeping the catalogue's paid material and technology truth.

  Purpose fixtures are deterministic render/function wrappers from ObjectBlueprints.xml. The
  bore, furnaces, forge, anvil, press, stores, baskets, and basins begin inert or empty; none
  imports a vanilla builder that digs, pumps, powers, fills, populates, or manufactures.
-->
